WEBVTT

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:01.440
Click Configuration

00:00:01.440 --> 00:00:02.460
in the sidebar,

00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:04.200
then open Post Style.

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:05.580
This is where you

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:06.870
shape the wording that goes

00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:08.250
with your vehicle information.

00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:10.800
Start with Dealer Playbook.

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:12.280
Look at the example

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:13.300
in the app,

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:15.090
then replace it with clear

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:16.790
information your dealership

00:00:16.790 --> 00:00:18.650
actually wants buyers to read.

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:21.880
Managers and admins set

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:23.320
the shared dealership wording,

00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:24.660
so agree on it before

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:25.960
changing it for the team.

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:27.380
For example:

00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:29.030
Financing available.

00:00:29.030 --> 00:00:30.430
Trade-ins welcome.

00:00:30.790 --> 00:00:31.950
We speak Spanish.

00:00:31.950 --> 00:00:33.380
Use only

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:34.800
statements your store has

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:36.800
approved and services it offers.

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:39.220
Add the dealership's approved

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:40.860
fee wording where appropriate;

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:42.860
don't copy another store's

00:00:42.860 --> 00:00:44.240
fees into your own listings.

00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:45.980
Check for spelling

00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:47.600
mistakes and repeated lines

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:49.140
before saving your changes.

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:51.960
My Listing Additions

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:53.630
is your closing information at

00:00:53.630 --> 00:00:55.010
the bottom of the description.

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:56.420
You could write:

00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:58.120
Please message me for more

00:00:58.120 --> 00:00:59.290
pictures and information.

00:00:59.440 --> 00:01:00.460
My phone number

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:01.480
is in my bio.

00:01:01.780 --> 00:01:03.220
Then include your approved

00:01:03.220 --> 00:01:04.240
contact email.

00:01:04.240 --> 00:01:06.050
If you mention your phone

00:01:06.050 --> 00:01:07.070
number in your bio,

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:08.360
add it to your Facebook

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:10.220
profile as well and check

00:01:10.220 --> 00:01:11.540
that shoppers can see it.

00:01:12.110 --> 00:01:13.790
Listing Additions doesn't

00:01:13.790 --> 00:01:15.430
update your profile for you.

00:01:16.490 --> 00:01:17.710
Now look at the complete

00:01:17.710 --> 00:01:18.730
finished listing.

00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:20.610
The vehicle features

00:01:20.610 --> 00:01:22.710
and optional emojis come first,

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.210
followed by dealership

00:01:24.210 --> 00:01:25.600
information and the closing

00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:26.620
contact line.

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:28.430
This example also

00:01:28.430 --> 00:01:29.810
shows fee wording.

00:01:30.430 --> 00:01:31.830
Read the whole description

00:01:31.830 --> 00:01:33.590
after posting to make sure

00:01:33.590 --> 00:01:34.850
it says what you intended.

00:01:34.850 --> 00:01:36.900
For practice,

00:01:36.920 --> 00:01:39.080
draft one shared dealership line

00:01:39.080 --> 00:01:41.160
and one personal closing line.

00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:42.480
Read them together

00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:44.400
and remove any duplication.
